title Detailed Cursor Rules Creation: Step-by-Step Process

start

:🔍 **Identify Mature Project** (Chatterbox);
note right: Project demonstrates:\n• AWS serverless architecture\n• Comprehensive automation\n• Configuration management\n• Quality practices\n• Documentation standards

:📊 **Analyze Existing Codebase**;
note right: Review:\n• Project structure\n• Development patterns\n• Automation approaches\n• Configuration strategies\n• Documentation practices

:📝 **Create Raw Instructions**;
note right: cursor_instructions_to_create_rules.txt\n• Define rule categories\n• Specify requirements\n• Outline process steps\n• Document expectations

:🤖 **Use Cursor AI to Refine Instructions**;
note right: Request AI to:\n• Clean up language\n• Improve structure\n• Add missing details\n• Make AI-ready

:✨ **Generate AI-Refined Instructions**;
note right: cursor_instructions_to_create_rules_after_ai.txt\n• Professional language\n• Clear structure\n• Comprehensive coverage\n• AI-optimized format

:⚙️ **Create Rule Files Based on Instructions**;
note right: Generate 9 specialized rule files:\n• Console Output & Display Rules\n• Menu Dashboard Rules\n• Library & Component Rules\n• Script Type Rules\n• Package.json Script Rules\n• CloudWatch Logging Rules\n• Initialization Rules\n• Configuration Management Rules\n• Folder Naming Rules

:🔗 **Update Main .cursorrules File**;
note right: Add references to:\n• All new rule files\n• Integration points\n• Usage guidelines

:📚 **Create Comprehensive Usage Guide**;
note right: docs/CURSOR_RULES_GUIDE.md\n• Rule explanations\n• Setup instructions\n• Usage examples\n• Troubleshooting

:📋 **Create Implementation Summary**;
note right: CURSOR_RULES_IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md\n• Implementation status\n• File statistics\n• Compliance verification\n• Results summary

:📖 **Create Confluence Documentation Package**;
note right: Cursor/Confluence/\n• Main introductory page\n• AI-ready instructions\n• Usage guide copy\n• Implementation summary\n• README for package

:🔒 **Update .gitignore for Large Files**;
note right: Add exclusions for:\n• Runtime data files\n• Generated responses\n• Test state files\n• Backup folders

:🗑️ **Remove Large Files from Tracking**;
note right: git rm --cached:\n• data/generated_responses.json\n• data/pending_emails_*.json\n• data/sendtest_*.txt\n• data/state.json

:💾 **Commit All Changes**;
note right: Comprehensive commit with:\n• Rule files\n• Documentation\n• Git ignore updates\n• File cleanup

:📤 **Push to Remote Repository**;
note right: Push to ses_and_cursor_rules branch\n• All rule files\n• Complete documentation\n• Automation scripts\n• Version control

:🔄 **Merge with Main Branch**;
note right: git checkout main\ngit merge ses_and_cursor_rules\n• Fast-forward merge\n• No conflicts\n• All changes integrated

:📤 **Push Updated Main**;
note right: git push origin main\n• Rules system in main\n• Documentation available\n• Ready for team use

:🌿 **Create New Development Branch**;
note right: git checkout -b pre_ai_integration\n• Based on updated main\n• Ready for AI integration work\n• All rules available

stop

